{'symbol': 'PFE', 'date': '2022-06-01 08:27:00', 'title': 'PFIZER PROVIDES UPDATE ON OWNERSHIP INTEREST IN HALEON', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--PFIZER INC. (NYSE: PFE) TODAY PROVIDED AN UPDATE ON ITS OWNERSHIP INTEREST IN HALEON PLC (HALEON), THE NEWLY INDEPENDENT COMPANY WHICH WILL HOLD THE JOINT CONSUMER HEALTHCARE BUSINESS OF GSK PLC (NYSE: GSK) AND PFIZER FOLLOWING THE DEMERGER OF APPROXIMATELY 80% OF GSK'S OWNERSHIP INTEREST IN THE BUSINESS TO GSK'S SHAREHOLDERS. FOLLOWING THE DEMERGER AND LISTING OF HALEON ON THE LONDON STOCK EXCHANGE (LSE), WHICH IS EXPECTED TO OCCUR IN JULY 2022, PFIZER WILL CONTINUE"}